	)
	(text "1. Use through-hole PC817C DIP-4 packages, axial 1N4148 diodes, and 1/4 W through-hole resistors on 2.54 mm perfboard.\n+2. J1 and J2 must be 2.54 mm right-angle, locking headers; do not use JST-GH directly on standard perfboard.\n+3. U1/U2: verify the RP23CNC output can act as a 5 V low-side sink before connecting. Do not apply controller 5 V to the toolhead side.\n+4. U3/R6: leave R6 unpopulated; E-18 must prove the RP23CNC A-home input's polarity and required pull-up before fitting it.\n+5. The PC817 only transfers light. CTRL_GND and TOOL_GND stay separate through this module."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 175.895 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5fbd0425-c125-453d-b130-c9060b00fb97")
	)
